# Pricing: rates (M2.5), price rules (M2.6), extras / protection / delivery / fees (M2.7-2.9). See prompt-reference/pricing_module.txt
# Money is integer pesewas (GHS 450.00 = 45000).
@baseUrl = {{$dotenv HTTP_BASE_URL}}

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{$dotenv HTTP_EMAIL}}", "password": "{{$dotenv HTTP_PASSWORD}}" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.$.data.token}}

### Pick a category to price
# @name categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/lookups/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@categoryId = {{categories.response.body.$.data[0].id}}

### 1. List rates (filters: categoryId, carId, driveType, active, scope=category|car)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/rate-plans?scope=category
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Self-drive rate for a category: GHS 450/day, 2,800/week, 10,500/month, unlimited km
# @name createRate
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "driveType": "self_drive",
  "dailyAmount": 45000,
  "weeklyAmount": 280000,
  "monthlyAmount": 1050000,
  "mileageMode": "unlimited"
}

###
@rateId = {{createRate.response.body.$.data.id}}

### 3. Chauffeur rate: in town 650/day, out of town 900/day, GHS 200 driver night allowance,
###    12h driver day then GHS 50/hour overtime, fuel not included
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "driveType": "chauffeur",
  "dailyAmount": 65000,
  "outOfTownDailyAmount": 90000,
  "driverOvernightAmount": 20000,
  "driverHoursPerDay": 12,
  "driverOvertimeHourAmount": 5000,
  "fuelIncluded": false
}

### 4. Schedule a price change: end the current rate on 31 Dec (PUT sends the full rate)...
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/rate-plans/{{rateId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "driveType": "self_drive",
  "dailyAmount": 45000,
  "weeklyAmount": 280000,
  "monthlyAmount": 1050000,
  "mileageMode": "unlimited",
  "effectiveTo": "2026-12-31"
}

### 5. ...and add the new one from 1 Jan (409 E_RATE_OVERLAP if the dates overlap)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/rate-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "driveType": "self_drive",
  "dailyAmount": 50000,
  "mileageMode": "limited",
  "includedKmPerDay": 200,
  "excessKmAmount": 150,
  "effectiveFrom": "2027-01-01"
}


### ── Price rules (M2.6) ──────────────────────────────────────────

### 6. List rules (filters: search, type=season|holiday|weekend, active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/pricing-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Christmas season every year: +25%, at least 3 days, all cars
# @name christmas
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/pricing-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Christmas season",
  "type": "season",
  "dateFrom": "2026-12-20",
  "dateTo": "2027-01-05",
  "recursYearly": true,
  "adjustmentType": "percent",
  "adjustmentValue": 2500,
  "minRentalDays": 3,
  "priority": 10
}

### 8. Weekends (Fri-Sun): +GHS 50/day for one category
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/pricing-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Weekend SUV surcharge",
  "type": "weekend",
  "weekdays": [5, 6, 7],
  "adjustmentType": "fixed",
  "adjustmentValue": 5000,
  "appliesTo": "categories",
  "categoryIds": ["{{categoryId}}"]
}

### 9. Independence Day promo: -10%, one day every year
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/pricing-rules
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Independence Day promo",
  "type": "holiday",
  "dateFrom": "2027-03-06",
  "recursYearly": true,
  "adjustmentType": "percent",
  "adjustmentValue": -1000,
  "priority": 20
}

### 10. Delete a rule
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/pricing-rules/{{christmas.response.body.$.data.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ── Extras, protection plans, delivery zones, fees (M2.7 - M2.9) ──

### 11. Extras (filters: search, active)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/extras
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Add an extra: child seat, GHS 30/day, 4 in stock, max 2 per booking (extras.manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/extras
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Child seat", "chargeType": "per_day", "amount": 3000, "maxQuantity": 2, "stock": 4 }

### 13. Protection plans
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/protection-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Add the default plan (making it default clears any other default)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/protection-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Basic cover", "perDayAmount": 0, "excessAmount": 500000, "isDefault": true }

### 15. Delivery zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery-zones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Add a zone: airport delivery/collection GHS 150, after hours +GHS 100
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/delivery-zones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Kotoka International Airport (KIA)", "deliveryAmount": 15000, "collectionAmount": 15000, "afterHoursAmount": 10000 }

### 17. Fees (standard ones come from the seeder)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 18. Add a custom fee (code is fixed after creation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/fees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "code": "towing", "name": "Towing", "unit": "flat", "amount": 80000 }


### ── Taxes (M2.10) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 19. Taxes + the VAT switch (context.vatRegistered)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/taxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 20. Add a tax - ILLUSTRATIVE ONLY, use the rates from your accountant (settings.manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/taxes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Example levy", "rateBp": 250, "calculation": "on_net", "appliesTo": ["rental", "extras", "protection", "delivery", "fees"] }

### 21. Taxes are charged only while the business profile says VAT registered
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/business
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "vatRegistered": true, "vatNumber": "C0001234567" }
